  "id": "slow-cooker-pulled-pork",
  "name": "Slow-Cooker Pulled Pork",
  "subtitle": "Tender pork with a sweet, tangy barbecue-style sauce",
  "description": "Marinate pork in a mustard-honey beer mixture, then slow-cook it with onion until tender enough to shred.",
